{
  "version":1,"name":"Warehouse availability","requirements":"Return an array of {sku, available, label}. items must be an array. sku and label must be non-empty strings. Legacy name takes precedence over displayName only when it is a non-empty string. available takes precedence over availableUnits when present; zero is valid. The chosen availability must be a non-negative integer. Missing or invalid fields must throw exactly Unsupported stock response. Do not guess a default stock count.",
